@startuml
hide circle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam monochrome true

' =================================================================
' NOTA ARCHITETTURALE — DB layer vs API layer
' =================================================================
' Questo diagramma rappresenta il DB layer (MongoDB/Beanie).
'
' API layer (HTTP) — principio UUID-first:
'   - path params:  sempre UUID  (GET /datasets/{uuid})
'   - body input:   sempre UUID  (dataset_uuid, model_uuid, ...)
'   - response:     solo uuid    (_id mai esposto al client)
'
' Il router è il solo punto che risolve UUID → ObjectId internamente.
' =================================================================

' =========================
' Core entities
' =========================

class User {
  +_id: ObjectId
  +uuid: UUID <<unique>>
  +email: EmailStr <<unique>>
  +first_name: string?
  +last_name: string?
  +hashed_password: string?
  +provider: string?
  +picture: string?
  +role: UserRole
  +team_uuid: UUID?
  +is_active: bool
  +is_superuser: bool
  +created_at: datetime
  +last_login_at: datetime?
}

note right of User
  role enum: admin | researcher | viewer
  hashed_password is None for SSO users.
  team_uuid references Team.uuid (not _id):
  cross-entity refs on User use UUID.
end note

class Team {
  +_id: ObjectId
  +uuid: UUID <<unique>>
  +name: string <<unique>>
  +description: string?
  +owner_user_uuid: UUID?
  +created_at: datetime
}

note right of Team
  Membership: User.team_uuid → Team.uuid
  (no member_user_ids array on Team)
end note

class Dataset {
  +_id: ObjectId
  +uuid: UUID <<unique>>
  +name: string
  +version: string
  +task: TaskType
  +description: string?
  +splits: Splits?
  +visibility: Visibility
  +team_id: ObjectId? <<indexed>>
  +created_by_user_id: ObjectId? <<indexed>>
  +created_at: datetime
}

note right of Dataset
  task enum: ranking | rating_prediction
  visibility enum: public | private
  splits: { train: int?, test: int?, validation: int? }
  Unique identity: {name, version}
end note

class MLModel {
  +_id: ObjectId
  +uuid: UUID <<unique>>
  +name: string <<unique>>
  +family: string?
  +paper_url: string?
  +implementation: string?
  +hyperparams: object?
  +created_by_user_id: ObjectId? <<indexed>>
  +created_at: datetime
}

note right of MLModel
  Represents an algorithm (e.g. BPR-MF, LightGCN),
  not a trained instance.
  hyperparams: default/typical params for this algorithm.
  Run-specific hyperparams live on Experiment.
end note

class Experiment {
  +_id: ObjectId
  +uuid: UUID <<unique>>
  +dataset_id: ObjectId <<indexed>>
  +model_id: ObjectId <<indexed>>
  +submitted_by_user_id: ObjectId <<indexed>>
  +team_id: ObjectId? <<indexed>>
  +run_name: string?
  +status: Status
  +hyperparams: object?
  +training_config: object?
  +seed: int?
  +notes: string?
  +code: CodeInfo?
  +artifacts: Artifacts?
  +created_at: datetime
  +finished_at: datetime?
}

note bottom of Experiment
  status enum: queued | running | finished | failed

  CodeInfo: { git_commit, repo_url, docker_image }
  Artifacts: { logs_url, model_path, predictions_path }

  Useful indexes:
  - {dataset_id, model_id, created_at:-1}
  - {submitted_by_user_id, created_at:-1}
  - {team_id, created_at:-1}
  - {status, created_at:-1}
end note

class Metric {
  +_id: ObjectId
  +uuid: UUID <<unique>>
  +experiment_id: ObjectId <<indexed>>
  +dataset_id: ObjectId <<indexed>>
  +model_id: ObjectId <<indexed>>
  +submitted_by_user_id: ObjectId? <<indexed>>
  +team_id: ObjectId? <<indexed>>
  +split: Split
  +metric: string <<indexed>>
  +k: int?
  +value: float
  +direction: Direction
  +computed_at: datetime
}

note right of Metric
  split enum: validation | test
  direction enum: max | min

  Denormalization:
  dataset_id, model_id, submitted_by_user_id, team_id
  are copied from Experiment at write time.
  Purpose: leaderboard queries are index-only (no $lookup).

  Key indexes:
  - {dataset_id, split, metric, value:-1}
  - {team_id, dataset_id, split, metric, value:-1}
  - {submitted_by_user_id, dataset_id, split, metric}
  - {experiment_id}
end note

' =========================
' Relationships
' =========================

User "1" -- "0..*" Dataset       : creates >
User "1" -- "0..*" MLModel       : creates >
User "1" -- "0..*" Experiment    : submits >
User "0..*" -- "0..1" Team       : belongs to >

Team "1" -- "0..*" Dataset       : owns/private >
Team "1" -- "0..*" Experiment    : owns >

Dataset "1" -- "0..*" Experiment : evaluated on >
MLModel "1" -- "0..*" Experiment : runs >
Experiment "1" -- "1..*" Metric  : produces >

@enduml

